PART B - CLUB CONTENT AND PERSONAL DATA (all rights reserved)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are NOT licensed under Part A. All rights are reserved, and they
may not be copied, reused, modified or redistributed without prior written
permission from Cobra Smash Badminton Club:

1. All images and graphics, including everything in public/assets/images/
   (player photos, match and event graphics, the club logo and all icons and
   favicons derived from it), and all video, including everything in
   public/assets/videos/ (match and event clips).

2. All content data, including everything in public/data/ (player names,
   nicknames, roles and photo references, testimonials, news and slider
   content). This includes personal data of club members, which must not be
   collected, reused or republished.

3. The club's name, logo and branding, including "Cobra Smash", "Cobra Smash
   Badminton Club" and "Cobras" as used to identify the club.

4. The club's contact details, including its email addresses, phone numbers
   and social media accounts.

5. The club's written text in public/index.html and elsewhere, including the
   club story, ambitions, session details, FAQ answers, sponsorship text and
   page metadata describing the club.

Anyone reusing the Source Code must remove or replace all Part B material
with their own.

